+             * open, because both experiments kept the lists of probes T and S
+             * (identical WXYZ swap on every format, so forcing is_mutable
+             * changed no swap at all):
+             *
+             *   T  non-sparse, tiled, UBWC on,  MUTABLEEN on -> 0 -> 261120/262144
+             *   S  sparse,      tiled, UBWC off, MUTABLEEN on -> 0 -> 16384/16384
+             *   H  non-sparse, tiled, UBWC off, MUTABLEEN on -> EXACT, no change
