+             *      both formats, so it only shows MUTABLEEN is harmless when
+             *      the swaps agree)
+             *
+             * This is the missing combination, and the one that decides the
+             * open question: tiled + UBWC *off* + MUTABLEEN on a list whose
+             * swaps actually differ.  In this branch UBWC is already off
+             * (set a few lines above), so setting is_mutable here gives
+             * exactly that, and leaves the probes with a compatible list
+             * (G, T) untouched, because they never reach this branch.
+             */
+            is_mutable = true;
